@startuml 10_ga_jobs
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
title GA 每日作业链时序 (GaJobRunner)

participant "定时器\n(17:30 交易日)" as timer
participant "GaJobRunner\n(单线程+互斥锁)" as runner
participant "FeatureService" as feat
participant "PredictJob" as pred
participant "VerifyJob" as verify
participant "MetricService" as metric
participant "PoolService" as pool
database "ga_job_log" as log

timer ->> runner : 触发日链路
runner ->> feat : FeatureJob(增量)
feat -->> log : SUCCESS/FAILED
runner ->> pred : PredictJob\n(冠军+影子)
pred -->> log : 写 ga_prediction
runner ->> verify : VerifyJob\n(到期回填/VOID)
verify -->> log : 更新 ga_prediction
runner ->> metric : MetricJob\n(汇总/IC/衰减)
metric -->> log : 写 ga_metric_daily
runner ->> pool : PoolJob(周全量)
pool -->> log : 更新 ga_stock_pool
note over runner : 周六 02:00 另跑 EvolveJob\n(5周期 GA 进化→冠军准入)\n非交易日自动跳过\n前端「参数配置」页可手动触发
@enduml
